  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participation of experts in circular textile workshop in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity facilitates the participation of a senior expert and a director from the Netherlands Ministry of Infrastructure and Water Management in a multistakeholder workshop and policy dialogue. The engagement supports strengthened cooperation with the Government of Bangladesh and provides insight into the alignment of Dutch circular textile objectives with ongoing bilateral collaboration efforts.</narrative>
